   "uploader": "ralphlawson",
   "uploader_id": "2898",
   "uploader_url": "https://soundcloud.com/ralphlawson",
   "timestamp": 1793208308,
   "title": "daft punk feb 97 dj mix",
   "track": "daft punk feb 97 dj mix",
   "description": "This mix was sent for me to play as a guest mix on my radio show Trans Europe Express on KISS FM 105 in Feb '97 as promo for their first album Homework. It's quite possible it was sent to other stations. The mix was sent on DAT (Digital Audio Tape) and comes off the original tape so excellent recording quality.   It was most definitely all mixed on vinyl, you can hear the crackles. \n\nThe tape had sat in a box for nearly 30 years and although in a dry spot had developed mould and ripped when I tried to play it so sent to be restored at The Great Bear in Bristol.  When it came back I checked levels and added just a small amount of limiting to get it up to modern day mix levels. I didn't add any compression as daft punk were famous for their expert use of side chain compression which gives the tracks on Homework their signature sound so didn't want to mess with it.\n\nThe photo is taken from their live Decks n FX appearance at back to basics at The Pleasure Rooms in January '97 before they wore helmets.  I wish we had recorded that night as it was 4 hours long, but as far as I know, no recording exists. \n\nralph lawson - oct '26",
   "duration": 3639.06,
